{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What if your sleep paralysis demon is more creative than you think?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;When Eyes Close&quot;</strong> is a collection of standalone psychological stories. Choose a protagonist whose fate you wish to experience and dive into the nightmare of sleep paralysis, where an unseen force binds your body, and the demon at your bedside offers a deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/66398958628cf12ec422b9717128020a.poster.avif?t=1756978587\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/66398958628cf12ec422b9717128020a.webm?t=1756978587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/66398958628cf12ec422b9717128020a.mp4?t=1756978587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to awaken. But the path to it lies through a labyrinth of  rooms, filled with fragmented memories that might belong to your hero... or to someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/3b083f8ef0985b7ea9889efbcdef4c5f.poster.avif?t=1756978587\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/3b083f8ef0985b7ea9889efbcdef4c5f.webm?t=1756978587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/3b083f8ef0985b7ea9889efbcdef4c5f.mp4?t=1756978587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore.</strong> Delve into the details. Every object, every note could be a key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember.</strong> Piece together the story and appearance of your protagonist. Who are they? What did they do? Or what was done to them?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guess.</strong> Find the one true bed among a sequence of random rooms that is yours. It is your only chance to break free.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/699db96bd284ed89fcac1bc183183a7b.poster.avif?t=1756978587\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/699db96bd284ed89fcac1bc183183a7b.webm?t=1756978587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/extras/699db96bd284ed89fcac1bc183183a7b.mp4?t=1756978587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every story is a separate life, but not every ending is an awakening. And even if it is, was it worth waking up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812640?t=1756978587","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812640?t=1756978587","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/d3a1c35613da4b3cf1b1be44eea1eb07b880842f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756978587","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812640/d3a1c35613da4b3cf1b1be4